{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"苏轼·influence-and-legacy","stage":"DONE","category":"su-shi","categoryLabel":"苏轼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/26_su-shi/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"苏轼-影响与遗产-简介\">苏轼·影响与遗产 — 简介</h1><p>本部分（影响与遗产）追问一个问题：<strong>苏轼死后近千年，他是如何被一代代人塑造、纪念、再生产，并最终走出国境的？</strong> 注意它与兄弟 hub 的边界——本部分不评价他的文学/艺术成就本身（那属 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 与 <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要作品</a>），不分析他的思想（属 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>），也不复述他的人生经历（属 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>）。本部分专注于<strong>身后的接受史与影响史</strong>：偶像如何生成、人格范型如何传导、当代如何被重新激活、如何跨文化出海。</p>\n<p>对其&quot;完人&quot;形象的反思与争议，请并读 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>——本部分讲&quot;为何被景仰&quot;，那一部分讲&quot;景仰是否过度&quot;，二者互为镜像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本部分三章分工\">本部分三章分工</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>回答的核心问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 <a href=\"the-beloved-dongpo/\">千古东坡</a></td>\n<td>偶像的生成机制</td>\n<td>&quot;东坡&quot;这个符号是如何从一个罪臣名号被塑造出来的？哪些是史实、哪些是附会？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 <a href=\"shaping-chinese-aesthetics/\">塑造中国审美</a></td>\n<td>人格范型与日常美学</td>\n<td>他给&quot;理想读书人&quot;提供了什么新答案？这套人格如何下沉到饮食起居？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 <a href=\"enduring-appeal/\">持久的吸引力</a></td>\n<td>当代与跨国的再生产</td>\n<td>他为何在今天成为顶流？又如何走出国境？</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ol>\n<li>先读 <a href=\"the-beloved-dongpo/a-cultural-icon\">《千古东坡》</a>：它建立全篇方法论——区分&quot;符号&quot;与&quot;史实&quot;（以东坡肉的祛魅为例），这是读懂后续各篇的钥匙。</li>\n<li>再读 <a href=\"the-beloved-dongpo/dongpo-the-man\">《性情中人》</a>：把&quot;重情、幽默、旷达&quot;还原回具体作品与日期，看清偶像背后那个可考的人。</li>\n<li>进入 <a href=\"shaping-chinese-aesthetics/the-scholar-ideal\">《士大夫的典范》</a> 与 <a href=\"shaping-chinese-aesthetics/food-and-life\">《生活的艺术家》</a>：从庙堂人格到锅碗瓢盆，看这套范型的两个层面。</li>\n<li>收尾于 <a href=\"enduring-appeal/su-shi-today\">《苏轼的当代意义》</a> 与 <a href=\"enduring-appeal/global-reach\">《走向世界的苏轼》</a>：把前面建立的人格与美学，投射到今天与海外。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本部分前，建议先了解苏轼的基本生平脉络，尤其是构成其偶像叙事核心的三次贬谪——<a href=\"../life-and-times/a-career-of-exile/the-wutai-poetry-case\">乌台诗案</a>、<a href=\"../life-and-times/a-career-of-exile/huangzhou-and-beyond\">黄州及以后</a>、<a href=\"../life-and-times/the-final-years/furthest-exile-hainan\">海南最远之贬</a>。理解他&quot;在失败中如何自处&quot;（<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/transcending-adversity/equanimity-in-hardship\">思想与方法·逆境中的安然</a>），是把握其影响力根源的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"贯穿全篇的两条主线\">贯穿全篇的两条主线</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>史实 vs 符号</strong>：苏轼的影响力建立在很小的史实内核（几篇诗文、苏堤水利）与极大的符号外延（东坡肉、地名、文创）之上。本部分反复训练读者分辨二者，杜绝把民间附会当信史。</li>\n<li><strong>担当 vs 旷达</strong>：苏轼的旷达以担当为前提。抽掉担当只取旷达，就退化为犬儒或鸡汤——这是阅读&quot;影响与遗产&quot;时最需警惕的反模式。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-beloved-dongpo","title":"The Beloved Dongpo","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/influence-and-legacy/the-beloved-dongpo","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-cultural-icon","title":"千古东坡：一个文化偶像如何被塑造","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/influence-and-legacy/the-beloved-dongpo/a-cultural-icon"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dongpo-the-man","title":"性情中人：从作品里还原一个具体的苏轼","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/influence-and-legacy/the-beloved-dongpo/dongpo-the-man"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"shaping-chinese-aesthetics","title":"Shaping Chinese Aesthetics","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/influence-and-legacy/shaping-chinese-aesthetics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-scholar-ideal","title":"士大夫的典范：苏轼如何定义了\"理想的读书人\"","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/influence-and-legacy/shaping-chinese-aesthetics/the-scholar-ideal"},{"seq":2,"slug":"food-and-life","title":"生活的艺术家：苏轼的日常美学及其传播史","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/influence-and-legacy/shaping-chinese-aesthetics/food-and-life"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-appeal","title":"Enduring Appeal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/influence-and-legacy/enduring-appeal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"su-shi-today","title":"苏轼的当代意义：从\"古人\"到\"顶流\"的再生产","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/influence-and-legacy/enduring-appeal/su-shi-today"},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-reach","title":"走向世界的苏轼：传播路径、关键译介与跨文化共鸣","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/influence-and-legacy/enduring-appeal/global-reach"}]}]}